{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/74998-we-need-the-hype","id":74998,"title":"We need the hype!","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Werewolf: The Forsaken"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-02-19T09:06:48-08:00","id":74998,"title":"We need the hype!","content":"I understand the Developer and crew are working hard on Idigam Chronicles and a ton of other books for Onyx Path. But we definitely could use a few teasers to show people something to grab their attention for Forsaken again. Not saying we need full open development, but something would nice.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/717-monghani","name":"Monghani","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar717_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"358"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-19T10:24:42-08:00","id":75048,"title":"","content":"<i>I just want that chronicle anthology!!!</i>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /> WoD-Dark Eras!! (Backed for Viking Age Werewolf)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1939-lyrics-of-war","name":"Lyrics Of War","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1939_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1769"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-19T11:26:25-08:00","id":75088,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Monghani</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/74998-we-need-the-hype#post74998\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I understand the Developer and crew are working hard on Idigam Chronicles and a ton of other books for Onyx Path. But we definitely could use a few teasers to show people something to grab their attention for Forsaken again. Not saying we need full open development, but something would nice.</div> </div> </div> </div>I can't speak for Stew, but I suspect that there will be information forthcoming. I'm pretty sure he's said that he will make some blog posts. He's just developing both Werewolf: the Apocalypse and <b>Werewolf: the Forsaken</b> so he's a rather busy guy. Patience, young grasshopper. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>This space for rent.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/552-strider1276","name":"strider1276","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar552_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"382"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-19T11:38:22-08:00","id":75096,"title":"","content":"Yeah he said he'd do blogs. The chronicle is still a fair ways off, in July. I'd like the anthology too, I really enjoyed the Strix one.<br /> <br /> So far this is all I've gathered from it:<br /> <span style=\"color:#3E3E3E\"><span style=\"font-family:Tahoma\">* Harmony's changing. Doesn't it seem weird that low-Harmony makes you &quot;too spirit&quot; when high-Harmony makes you balanced? Where's the end for &quot;too human&quot;?</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#3E3E3E\"><span style=\"font-family:Tahoma\">* Tribes are the &quot;What?&quot;, Auspices are the &quot;How?&quot;, and the Idigam are the Outside Context Problem.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#3E3E3E\"><span style=\"font-family:Tahoma\">* Gifts and renown are a sore spot that will see significant attention.<br /> <br /> And about how vampires and werewolves interact with both being apex predators:<br /> &quot;An MI6 agent observes a CIA man in 1974 Moscow. She knows what he is \u2014 she can tell by the newspapers he reads, by the routes he drives and what brands of cigarettes he buys on what days. She doesn't need to ask him, and he doesn't need to ask her.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#3E3E3E\"><span style=\"font-family:Tahoma\">&quot;Every month or so, they meet in a park; mostly, they exchange pleasantries and empty platitudes. Sometimes they share information \u2014 or disinformation \u2014 but broadly, they both have the same goal. She may set a bomb under a junior minister's car; he may spend a night with a senior security guard, turning him into a double agent. Their methods are different, but they both want the same thing in the end. They come from different places, but you can recognize them by their similarities as much as their differences.&quot;<br /> <br /> And lastly I believe Rose said that that a thought regarding their abilities would be emphasizing the hunt (though that this was just an example, no powers were given). It's somewhere in the vampire board in a thread about celerity.</span></span>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-20T03:04:49-08:00","id":75502,"title":"","content":"Would love to give you some tidbits to be hyped by, but that's not really my call, it's Stew's <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> I imagine he'll get round to it sooner or later <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> As an addition to nofather's list above, remember that the game's new key phrase is 'The Wolf Must Hunt'.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>- Chris Allen, Aberrant Line Developer, Freelance Writer<br /> <br /> \u200bLike my work? Feel like helping me stay supplied with tea? Check out my <b><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/acrozatarim\" target=\"_blank\">Patreon</a></b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1757-acrozatarim","name":"Acrozatarim","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1757_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1892"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-06T14:58:14-08:00","id":85654,"title":"","content":"Understandable, and thanks for the response. Just languishing in pain as the lack of spoilers. :&lt;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/m